{"words": [{"text": "وَقَالُوا۟", "translation": "And they said"}, {"text": "لَن", "translation": "Never"}, {"text": "يَدْخُلَ", "translation": "will enter"}, {"text": "ٱلْجَنَّةَ", "translation": "the Paradise"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "who"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "هُودًا", "translation": "(a) Jew[s]"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "نَصَـٰرَىٰ ۗ", "translation": "(a) Christian[s]"}, {"text": "تِلْكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "أَمَانِيُّهُمْ ۗ", "translation": "(is) their wishful thinking"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "هَاتُوا۟", "translation": "Bring"}, {"text": "بُرْهَـٰنَكُمْ", "translation": "your proof"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "translation": "you are"}, {"text": "صَـٰدِقِينَ", "translation": "[those who are] truthful"}], "sahih": "And they say, \"None will enter Paradise except one who is a Jew or a Christian.\" That is [merely] their wishful thinking. Say, \"Produce your proof, if you should be truthful.\""}